From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:20:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: apple: cluster-pwrgate: Add the
 T8132 compatible

The J604's (T8132) ADT has the PMGR window that holds the CPU cluster
power-gate enables on T8140, at the same offset in PMGR. Add
apple,t8132-cluster-pwrgate, with apple,cluster-pwrgate as fallback,
so the J604 device tree can describe the node. It stays disabled there
until a read-only probe shows the word layout.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
(cherry picked from commit 74e372d44df040dba1dd1096f6761894bd6c7f9a)
(cherry picked from commit 56a1ea03ccbcfaa3df42afc05b85deaf6f7cc692)
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,cluster-pwrgate.yaml     | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,cluster-pwrgate.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,cluster-pwrgate.yaml
index 8d4e6ab002..c73e77e7ac 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,cluster-pwrgate.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,cluster-pwrgate.yaml
@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     items:
       - enum:
+          - apple,t8132-cluster-pwrgate
           - apple,t8140-cluster-pwrgate
       - const: apple,cluster-pwrgate
 
